%
(TCPC H3 B0-to-B90 Z log check)
(No probing. No physical tool installed. Selects T3 and applies G43 H3.)

G17 G21 G40 G49 G54 G64 P0.001 G80 G90 G92.1 G94

o<preview_guard> if [#<_task> EQ 0]
  (DEBUG, TCPC_H3_B0_B90_Z_LOG preview only)
  M2
o<preview_guard> endif

o<tlo_start_check> if [ABS[#<_hal[motion.tooloffset.z]>] GT 0.001]
  (abort, B0/B90 Z log requires zero active Z tool offset at start)
o<tlo_start_check> endif
o<tcpc_off_check> if [#<_hal[headheadtwp.tcpc_enabled]> GT 0.5]
  (abort, B0/B90 Z log must start with TCPC off)
o<tcpc_off_check> endif
o<twp_off_check> if [#<_hal[headheadtwp.motion_enabled]> GT 0.5]
  (abort, B0/B90 Z log must start with TWP motion off)
o<twp_off_check> endif
o<b_zero_check> if [ABS[#<_hal[headheadtwp.current_joint_b]>] GT 0.05]
  (abort, B0/B90 Z log must start near B0)
o<b_zero_check> endif
o<c_zero_check> if [ABS[#<_hal[headheadtwp.current_joint_c]>] GT 0.05]
  (abort, B0/B90 Z log must start near C0)
o<c_zero_check> endif

(MSG, No physical tool installed. Virtual T3/H3 will be applied. B90 should move commanded Z about -308.8mm from B0 if H3 is included, about -180.2mm if only spindle nose is used.)
M0

M61 Q3
M66 E0 L0 (force sync after selected-tool change)
o<tool_3_check> if [ABS[#<_current_tool> - 3] GT 0.5]
  (abort, M61 Q3 did not set current tool 3)
o<tool_3_check> endif

G0 B0.0 C0.0
G43 H3
M66 E0 L0 (force sync after applying H3 tool length)
o<h3_z_check> if [ABS[#<_hal[motion.tooloffset.z]> - 128.606729] GT 0.002]
  (abort, G43 H3 did not apply expected H3 Z tool length)
o<h3_z_check> endif

#<start_x> = #<_x>
#<start_y> = #<_y>
#<start_z> = #<_z>

G43.4
o<tcpc_on_check> if [#<_hal[headheadtwp.tcpc_enabled]> LT 0.5]
  (abort, G43.4 did not enable TCPC)
o<tcpc_on_check> endif

M66 E0 L0
(DEBUG, TCPC_H3_B0_B90_Z_LOG B0 axis_z=#<_hal[axis.z.pos-cmd]> joint_z_cmd=#<_hal[joint.2.motor-pos-cmd]> joint_z_fb=#<_hal[joint.2.motor-pos-fb]> tlo_z=#<_hal[motion.tooloffset.z]> kins_tool_z=#<_hal[headheadkins.tool-offset.z]>)
(MSG, Logged B0 Z. Continue to move B90 with programmed XYZ held fixed.)
M0

F480
G1 X[#<start_x>] Y[#<start_y>] Z[#<start_z>] B90.0 C0.0
M66 E0 L0
(DEBUG, TCPC_H3_B0_B90_Z_LOG B90 axis_z=#<_hal[axis.z.pos-cmd]> joint_z_cmd=#<_hal[joint.2.motor-pos-cmd]> joint_z_fb=#<_hal[joint.2.motor-pos-fb]> tlo_z=#<_hal[motion.tooloffset.z]> kins_tool_z=#<_hal[headheadkins.tool-offset.z]>)
(MSG, Logged B90 Z. Expected joint_z_cmd delta from B0 is about -308.8mm with H3 active.)
M0

G1 X[#<start_x>] Y[#<start_y>] Z[#<start_z>] B0.0 C0.0
M66 E0 L0
(DEBUG, TCPC_H3_B0_B90_Z_LOG B0_RETURN axis_z=#<_hal[axis.z.pos-cmd]> joint_z_cmd=#<_hal[joint.2.motor-pos-cmd]> joint_z_fb=#<_hal[joint.2.motor-pos-fb]> tlo_z=#<_hal[motion.tooloffset.z]> kins_tool_z=#<_hal[headheadkins.tool-offset.z]>)
(MSG, Logged return B0. Continue to clear TCPC and G43.)
M0

G49.1
o<tcpc_off_end_check> if [#<_hal[headheadtwp.tcpc_enabled]> GT 0.5]
  (abort, G49.1 did not disable TCPC)
o<tcpc_off_end_check> endif

G49
M66 E0 L0 (force sync after clearing tool length)
o<tlo_end_check> if [ABS[#<_hal[motion.tooloffset.z]>] GT 0.001]
  (abort, G49 did not clear virtual H3 tool length)
o<tlo_end_check> endif
M61 Q0

(DEBUG, TCPC_H3_B0_B90_Z_LOG complete)
M30
%
